                                "sense_id": "57d922a4-db7d-3294-805b-a85cc0821a6c",
                                "text": "The asymmetry of the bones too is remarkable, although this is characteristic of all the catodon whales, especially as regards the bones of the anterior narial passages, the left of which is very much larger than the right."
